TXT ============================================================;
TXT Example: Full wall element - all three NR rotation types combined;
TXT Demonstrates rx, ry and rz in a realistic prefab wall scenario;
TXT;
TXT Layer build-up (inside to outside):;
TXT  PLI1: Gypsum board 12.5mm;
TXT  Frame: UG/OG/LS 80x160mm;
TXT  PLA1: OSB sheathing 15mm;
TXT  PLA2: Horizontal ventilation battens 40x28mm (NR ry=10°);
TXT  PLA3: Vertical counter-battens 40x28mm (NR rx alternating ±15°);
TXT;
TXT Window opening at x=600..1400, y=800..2200;
TXT;
TXT NOTE: rx/ry/rz parameters require consultation with WEINMANN;
