TXT ==================== HORIZONTAL VENTILATION BATTENS ====================;
TXT PLA2: Horizontal battens 40x28mm on top of OSB;
TXT Purpose: Creates ventilation gap behind cladding;
TXT NR ry=10°: Nails tilted 10° around Y-axis for improved lateral shear resistance;
TXT The slight tilt prevents the batten from rotating under the cladding load;

